  data: {
    LLM: "Game: Idiots (Shithead/Palace). 2-6 players, 52-card deck (2 decks for 5+). Setup: 3 blind face-down, 3 table face-up, 3 hand. Swap: Players swap hand/table cards. Play: Must play equal/higher than discard top. Pick up pile if can't play. Magic: 2(reset) 7(reverse) 8(skip) 10(burn) 4-of-a-kind(burn). Win: First to shed all layers.",
    Player: "Welcome to Idiots (Shithead/Palace). You have three layers: hand cards, face-up table cards, and face-down blind cards. Play cards higher than the discard top. Can't play Pick up the pile. Magic cards shake it up: 2s reset, 7s reverse the direction, 8s skip, 10s burn. Last person with cards is the Idiot!",
    objective: 'Be the first to get rid of all cards (Hand -> Table -> Blind).',
    gameplay: '1. Starting: Player with the lowest card (usually 3) begins.\n2. Play: You must play a card equal to or HIGHER than the top card of the discard pile.\n3. **Picking Up**: If you cannot play, you must pick up the ENTIRE discard pile into your hand.\n4. **Magic Cards**: - **2s**: Reset the pile (can be played on any card). - **7s**: Next player must play a card equal to or LOWER than 7. - **8s**: Skip the next player. - **10s**: Burn the pile (it is removed from the game, and you play again). - **Four-of-a-kind**: Playing 4 of the same rank also burns the pile.',
    keyRules: [
      'Follow the legal action constraints defined for Idiots.',
      'Round outcome is resolved by the scoring method: Scoring summary: First player to shed all cards wins.',
      'Winning condition: Be the first to get rid of all cards (Hand -> Table -> Blind).',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
