      equipment: 'One deck for up to 4 players, two decks for 5+.',
      dealing: "1. Deal 3 cards face-down to each player (Blind cards).\n2. Deal 3 cards face-up on top of them (Table cards).\n3. Deal 3 cards to each player's hand.\n4. Players can swap hand cards with their face-up Table cards before play begins.",
    },
    turnFlow: '1. Starting: Player with the lowest card (usually 3) begins.\n2. Play: You must play a card equal to or HIGHER than the top card of the discard pile.\n3. **Picking Up**: If you cannot play, you must pick up the ENTIRE discard pile into your hand.\n4. **Magic Cards**: - **2s**: Reset the pile (can be played on any card). - **7s**: Next player must play a card equal to or LOWER than 7. - **8s**: Skip the next player. - **10s**: Burn the pile (it is removed from the game, and you play again). - **Four-of-a-kind**: Playing 4 of the same rank also burns the pile.',
